# Calamitous Cave-In: "deals X damage to each creature and each planeswalker, where X is the number of Caves you control plus the number
# of Cave cards in your graveyard."
# Turn 1 Bot1 controls a Promising Vein (a Cave land) and discards a Pit of Offerings (another Cave) and a Plains (not a Cave) to
# Faithless Looting: X = 1 + 1 = 2 (CR 205.3i). The 0/3 Phyrexian Walker survives with 2 damage marked, so the Plains was not counted.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Promising Vein
Faithless Looting
Calamitous Cave-In
Pit of Offerings
Phyrexian Walker
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Promising Vein.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Pit of Offerings; Plains)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Promising Vein.Activate(Ability: Add)
Bot1.Hand.Calamitous Cave-In.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Damage = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Damage = 2
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 5
